    {
      "find": "The best work happens when designers, engineers, and product folks are actually talking to each other—not throwing things over the wall. I genuinely enjoy the back-and-forth of figuring out what's possible, what's practical, and what's going to create the most value.",
      "replace": "The best work happens when design, engineering, and growth are in one conversation."
